111	 * the validated request in place so later steps persist and return the normalized value.
112	 * Syntactic validity is enforced declaratively by the {@code @Email} constraint on the
113	 * request DTO (checked at {@link ValidateOwner}), so a present but invalid address is already
114	 * rejected 400 before this step runs; a missing (null) email is left untouched.
