126	     * The single source of truth for an email's canonical form: lower-cased. Null-safe so it can
127	     * canonicalize an existing owner's (possibly absent) stored value. The canonical value is what is
128	     * stored and returned; it also composes the display-only
129	     * {@link org.springframework.samples.petclinic.model.Owner#getIdentityKey() identityKey} but no
130	     * longer participates in duplicate detection (which is household-based).
